TYPE="path_rules"
GLOB="test/**"

TEST_COMMAND:
- mix test
- mix test --trace for verbose output
- mix test test/my_app/foo_test.exs for a single file

TEST_CONVENTIONS:
- ExUnit — one test module per source module: FooTest mirrors Foo
- Use describe blocks to group related tests
- DataCase for DB-touching tests (wraps in transaction, rolls back)
- ConnCase for controller/LiveView tests
- Factory: ExMachina or manual fixture functions in test/support/

COVERAGE_REQUIREMENTS:
- (fill in — e.g., "mix test --cover; no hard threshold enforced")

FORBIDDEN_IN_TESTS:
- No real external HTTP calls — use Bypass or Mox
- No @tag :skip without a comment and tracking issue
- No async: true on tests that share DB state
